From 4eed4237ff77cb5832e98749e68d6e37704df4bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 04:43:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] test(kanban-sync): FakeService mirrors
 lease_run_uid; end-to-end lease_held release veto

FakeService's lease grant/clear never wrote lease_run_uid on the task row,
unlike hermes-hub transitions.ts setLease/clearLease, so the release
mootness veto in kanban_sync_rejections (card still leased by that run_uid
-> unresolved) was covered only by hand-set fixture rows.

- grant (lease_runs=True) sets lease_run_uid with lease_holder/lease_expires;
  every clear path (holder leaving running, release op, lease release) nulls it.
- New lease_runs=True test: grant via hub.leases, holder ends its run and drops
  current_run_uid while keeping the lease -> rejected release stays
  unresolved/retained; holder leaves running (clearLease) -> moot/retired.

Proof: RED without the fake change (KeyError lease_run_uid); mutants killed:
veto without lease_run_uid -> moot (expected unresolved); row_op clear
without lease_run_uid -> mirror stays set. All 49 test files importing the
fake board: 883 passed. Test-only; follow-up to PR #1866 review 5886021750.
---
 tests/hermes_cli/kanban_sync_fake_board.py    | 18 ++++----
 .../hermes_cli/test_kanban_sync_rejections.py | 41 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

